model px
  tally 2
  on 2026-03-01
  start 2026-01-01
  end 2026-12-31

source card "invented"
unit PLN: currency minor 0.01

input x: date
input y: date

ask q0: x == y with x = y

version v
  cite card
  governs always
  known 2026-01-01
  x = 2026-01-05 "c"
  y = window(2026-01-01, 2026-01-02) "c"
